Scenario: Remove updated team role from updated team on updated account
	Testing the ability to remove an updated team role from an updated team on updated account on Koroneiki that later gets synced to OSB

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORONEKORONE                         |
	| Contact Email Address | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Description           | Test osb account on koroneiki        |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                         |
	| Name                  | Korone - ${staticProjectName}        |
	| Notes                 | Additional account notes             |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                         |
	| Profile Email Address | osb.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Region                | United States                        |
	| Status                | Approved                             |
	| Tier                  | Regular                              |
	| Website               | www.koroneikicorporation.com         |
	And I create a team with the name "OSB Devlopr Team" for the account "Korone - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I create a team role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Liferay Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I assign the team with the name "OSB Devlopr Team" on the account "Korone - ${staticProjectName}" to the following roles
	| Liferay Account Role |
	And I update a koroneiki account with the name "Korone - ${staticProjectName}" to have the following values
	| Code                  | ONEIKIONEIKI                             |
	| Description           | Test update account on koroneiki         |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-4321                             |
	| Name                  | Oneiki - ${staticProjectName}            |
	| Notes                 | Some more account notes                  |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-8765                             |
	| Region                | Japan                                    |
	| Status                | Pending                                  |
	| Tier                  | Premier                                  |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiupdate.com                  |
	And I update a team with the name "OSB Devlopr Team" to have the new name "OSB Mktng Team"
	And I update a koroneiki team role with the name "Liferay Account Role" to have the following values
	| Description | This is the optional role for accounts |
	| Name        | NonLiferay Accnt Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                                |
	And I remove the team with the name "OSB Mktng Team" on the account "Oneiki - ${staticProjectName}" from the following roles
	| NonLiferay Accnt Role |
	And I log into the support homepage as "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" with password "test" on the sandbox
	And I go to the Project Details page on sandbox
	And I go to the project with the name "Oneiki - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I go to the History tab
	Then the history entry in position number "4" with the field value "Team Role" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin      |
	| Update Summary              | Assigned Team        |
	| Update Description          | OSB Devlopr Team     |
	| Update Date                 | Today                |
	| Update Field Name           | Team Role            |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                  |
	| Update Field New Value      | Liferay Account Role |
	And the history entry in position number "8" with the field value "Team Role" should be visible with the following values
	| Updater Name                | Koroneiki Admin       |
	| Update Summary              | Unassigned Team       |
	| Update Description          | OSB Mktng Team        |
	| Update Date                 | Today                 |
	| Update Field Name           | Team Role             |
	| Update Field Original Value | NonLiferay Accnt Role |
	| Update Field New Value      | N/A                   |